<article class="env-lemma" id="06LL">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06LL">Lemma <span data-tag="06LL">15.46.8</span>.</a> Given a Noetherian local ring $R$ we have $\text{depth}(R) = \text{depth}(R^ h) = \text{depth}(R^{sh})$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      By Lemma <a href="/tag/06LJ" data-tag="06LJ">15.46.3</a> we know that $R^ h$ and $R^{sh}$ are Noetherian. Hence the lemma follows from Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/0337" data-tag="0337">10.163.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>